            "review_title": "Review at The Grill Restaurant",
            "review_text": "ChrisSurb\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam309 contributions\n0\nDelicious Mekong Cuisine cooked to international standards\nOct 2020\nThe restaurant is centrally located and acts as an epicentre of the resort. We really enjoyed our breakfast and dinner. They have a fantastic mix of local dishes and international style and in many ways the cuisine was a highlight of our trip.\nWritten November 3, 2020",
