            "review_title": "Review at The Grill Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jane J\nKnokke-Heist, Belgium21 contributions\n0\nPerfect getaway from the city\nNov 2019 • Couples\nThis restaurant as well as the other restaurant, Le Cafe, in the hotel Azerai is a breath of fresh air in the hectic city of Can Tho!\nWe made a reservation because we were not staying in the hotel. The whole experience is wonderful, from the moment you step on the boat. The food is pricey but so worth it. The mashed potatoes are SO good!\nRead more\nWritten November 26, 2019",
