            "review_title": "Review at The Grill Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Thibault J\nLuang Prabang, Laos52 contributions\n0\nBest venue in town\nMar 2019 • Couples\nWe heard about the new Azeraï builded on an island in the middle of the river in Can Tho. Staying in the city center we decided to try it and to book a table for our last evening. \n\nWe got picked up by their superbe boat for a 5 minutes rides to the resort just at the good time to admire the sunset.\n\nDinner did not disappoint at all, service was top notch and the quality of the ingredients were above expectations. Reasonably priced, the grill present itself as the best restaurant in town. \nWe had the chance to meet Serge the GM who told us about the surrounding of Can Tho and the hidden gem of this area. \n\nWe had an amazing evening, we would visit again without hesitation.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 26, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
